Package: specbunch
Type: Package
Title: Spectral Bunching Mass and Buncher Means
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dylan", "Moore", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "dtmoore@hawaii.edu"),
    person("LLVM Project contributors", role = "cph", comment = "Optional compiled runtime; see COPYRIGHTS"),
    person("HiGHS authors and contributors", role = "cph", comment = "Bundled solver; see COPYRIGHTS"))
Description: Thin interfaces to deterministic spectral estimators implemented
    in a C++ core. Returns estimates, model-based standard errors, selection
    diagnostics and every named core output for simulated or user supplied data.
